   "like_count": 1,
   "cooked": "<p>The <a href=\"https://gardens.1hive.org/#/xdai/garden/0x1fc7e8d8e4bbbef77a4d035aec189373b52125a8/vote/35\">vote passed and was enacted.</a></p>\n<p>There will be a dress rehearsal conducted this week. Depending on the results a migration target date will be set for either December or January.</p>",
